<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8744] Web console: Incorrect behavior of cluster activation control</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8744</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;start node&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;activate&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;go to Queries history tab, click Refresh&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;deactivate cluster using component- after several seconds component gets switched to &apos;Activating...&apos; stage and hangs in this state for about minute&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</description>
