                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16505707" author="anovikov" created="Fri, 8 Jun 2018 05:01:38 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;After digging deeper into cluster activation found that cluster doesn&apos;t have state: activation in progress, deactivation in progress. I think we should emulate it on server side of Web-Console.&#160; Emulating on frontend side will be not displayed on other user tabs or for other user that what work with this cluster.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16942530" author="kuaw26" created="Wed, 2 Oct 2019 06:36:57 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This issue can not be fixed without changes in cluster behaviour.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
